{"server":"cn","storyId":"act4d0_level_act4d0_st02","groupId":"act4d0","stageId":null,"title":"破局者","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act4d0/level_act4d0_st02.txt","sourceHash":"9a78f634b071efcafaa782e2defcbefde24941cf0fc115f0381a7de3b89b586d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"W，我们遇到了点麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嚯......值得你们用这个频道联系我，怎么？发现了什么有趣的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不太有趣，W，在你重整那些萨卡兹雇佣兵的时候，有一支队伍叛逃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好像是支负责清扫战场的后勤队伍，所以我们直接发起了追击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"意料之内的，他们变成了一盘散沙，一触即溃，开始向城外撤离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可喜可贺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但，意料之外的情况是......我们派去追击的小队，和我们失去了联系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"作为佣兵们的新领头人，希望你能给出合理的解释。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们的小队为什么人间蒸发了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"01:13 P.M.    天气/晴\n切尔诺伯格，郊外，荒野"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"这种描述可不利于我理解喔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"事实如此。协同小队没发现埋伏和陷阱，只知道敌人是萨卡兹人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"那自然是萨卡兹了，我的佣兵还能有什么其他种族呢？不过，挺有趣的。接着说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最先接触的时候，目标被成功压制，出于谨慎，追击小队也有所保留。对方并不是什么强敌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然而某个时刻，通讯突然中断了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，比起你们，真正的野兽更善于隐藏自己的尖牙利齿，你们这也太大意了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们该怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"那些萨卡兹人有什么特点？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不清楚，目击者大都失去了联络。从远处看，只知道有一名近身陷阵的战士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"那就不要和他们正面接触。拖住那个人，我们一会见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动刀兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"出了什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，只是有一支不够成熟的小队中了诱饵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动刀兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要去支援他们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，明明大家都有自己的工作，为什么不能各自处理好分内的事情呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......不过这次就不深究了吧。毕竟我也非常在意我可怜的前领导带着哪些奇怪的萨卡兹人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动刀兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动刀兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"通知全体小队，临战整备，转移到城郊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，该死，这家伙的动作又变快了！他还在隐藏实力吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"......太弱小了，所谓的整合运动只有这种水平吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"你这家伙！竟然小看我们——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"本来就预想到会遇上几个老熟人，可没想到会是你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"W，我们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"归队，除非你想送死。别摆出那副急着报仇的表情，他还没有使出全力。哦，想送死的话，我就不拦着你咯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"......收队。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"很久不见了，佣兵刀术师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，叫我W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"炎客。你应该明白，于我而言，互报姓名的意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，可怕可怕，过去你手刃那些家伙的时候，也会互报姓名吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"委托和厮杀是不一样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"作为一个经历过那场战争的萨卡兹人忽然销声匿迹，很令人担心啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"佣兵嘛，只不过是换了个领头人就要跑路，让人很心慌喔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"这无关紧要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"不过没想到，你的部下连让我报上名字的价值都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"那还真是荣幸......嗯，虽然他们成为我部下也没多长时间。啊，你是在邀请我杀了你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我对你仰仗外力的战斗方式毫无兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"但我得承认，战术也是一种技巧。如果你的战术比过去更加精湛，我愿意领教。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"......奇怪，你过去不是那种“只要杀了目标怎么都好”的类型吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动刀兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"W，小队已经分散到了指定点，已经彻底切断了敌人的退路，他逃不掉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"我也没想到你能成为这些家伙的领导者，大家都在改变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"这些家伙？啊......你是说整合运动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说......萨卡兹们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动刀兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"喝——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动刀兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不会轻敌的，萨卡兹人，我注意你很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动刀兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"很可惜，你没有机会钻空子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，你也是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是有意思多了吗，你能作为砥石为我所用吗？我的刀有些钝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动刀兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"挑衅？你也就现在能嚣张两下了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动刀兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃！该死！你是怎么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动刀兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"你还有空说话吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"......意料之内，他变得更强了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"W！我们为什么就站在这里看着！？只要你下令，他立刻就会灰飞烟灭了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"所以现在，我又能对你发号施令了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"别在这种时候找茬！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"但我确实不是你们的指挥官呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"提个建议，收手吧，别刺激他了，自找麻烦最好换个时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动刀兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......该死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"不是吧？你难道真的打算单打独斗就解决他？别在这里搞笑啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动刀兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"下一个是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"这么着急，是赶着去赴谁的约吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是第一次杀出重围了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，嗯，原来如此。我想，你大概是在说内战时候的事吧？我有点兴趣，能说说吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么。被人埋伏，所有人死了而我还活着，就这么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样？还要继续吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"对我来说，刚才的战斗还远远不够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我在想，也许你应该加入我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"W！？他这个叛逃者，已经杀了那么多整合运动的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的佣兵们决定要用他，整合运动需要他。有意见？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么想，都是我们这边更有趣吧？战争，流血，还有那么多萨卡兹同僚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"你追求的一切在这里都是打折大放送哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，这份邀请也出于我个人的好奇心，我们一定有很多共同话题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"我不这么认为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是感染者吧？加入整合运动又有什么不好呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"无序的破坏，带着某种目的的集团暴行，我看不出能从这样的组织里得到什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"战争？现在的你们不过是摩擦迸发出的点点火种，你应该知道真正的战争是什么样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么说，我们也是有在努力工作的，何况整合运动之间也有区别嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我的前任上司喜欢更纯粹些的东西，但我可是无论什么都乐在其中啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"如果非要说的话......是呢，我想领教一下塔露拉的剑术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"那个龙女？虽然我不想称赞她，但你基本没有一丁点胜算喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"而且她那个，能算剑术吗？你在靠近她之前就会变成一块炭吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我也知道，如果我拒绝你的条件，我突围的机会同样小之又小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"可这又何妨？只有在令人窒息的枷锁中挣脱，我才有可能更进一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"你......什么时候变得这么有情调了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在寻求自己活着的意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，随你怎么说。不要管那个龙女了，单纯加入佣兵队伍如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"老工作的话，你也能更加得心应手吧。再说了，你不喜欢的上司，已经死了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"你并不值得信任。你我都互相隐瞒了很多事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵，有一个很不错的地方，那里比整合运动更适合磨砺我的刀刃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了。不久之前，我看到你和那个外来的萨卡兹人交易的场面。但除此之外，他们的战斗令我心动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"还有这种事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"就算他最后被你除掉了，事实就是事实，依然在那里。遮掩是没用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"真是败给你啦！行啦行啦。我确实和他口头约定好，让他干掉我的上司，方便我去做事呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟大家也是老相识了嘛，面子也是要卖一个的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"但你不可能放过他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"至少我放过了他想保护的人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"我答应他，会给罗德岛的救援队提供帮助——这和我杀死他这件事，也没什么矛盾吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"再说了，我也有自己的规划，钓线总要放长一些才行。但手上的猎物，也没理由让他跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"就算这样，他也消灭了你好不容易弄到手的精英战士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"够了！这事，我可还是很生气的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。难得遇到一位旧识，本来还以为能搞好关系，最后还是你死我活，我也很伤心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动刀兵","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......W，我们必须动手了。拖得太久会影响既定的计划。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，既然大家时间都很紧迫......你真的不打算改变你的看法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"自然不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"最后一个问题，你现在的雇主是谁？啊，抱歉，反正你是不会说的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"但我大致猜得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗，我以为他们没有那么有名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"我有不少旧识在那里。欸，虽然我的旧识到处都是啦，你也算是呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"前言不搭后语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我要说的是，我也许清楚一些你以前的佣兵队伍被消灭的内幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"尊敬的刀术师队长，策划了那次的阴谋，让你变成现在这样子的人，说不定就在你要去的地方哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，原来你不知道！当然了，我也是刚刚才知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"很快你就会发现，事情肯定没你想的那么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"我很期待你会怎么做，呵呵，你总会做些什么的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"W！你还要等到什么时候！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，说真的，我的萨卡兹们不会动手哦？要干活，你们自己去干。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"刀术师——不，炎客，在之后的战斗里，你可能会死。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac4_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"久违的死局。我很兴奋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"久违的？这么说来，也许你佣兵队的全灭并没让你变得冷酷，反而让你变得快乐起来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你没有相像之处，W，快乐不是值得追求的目标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"“上一次”让我失去了很多东西，但我眼前的道路却变得明晰而清澈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"这一次，希望你们不要让我失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"你居然在笑哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我说这次会饶你一命，你信吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"我，也想这么问。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"合同内容——似乎没有要求你在正式登舰前，就和整合运动正面冲突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"是我个人的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"我们欢迎感染者和有志于解决感染者问题的各类人才，但绝不接纳违反规则和条例的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"鉴于我们并不知道当时的具体情况，就不把这件事纳入考察了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"下不为例。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有必要，就按你们的方式处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经处理过了。你的动机和个人诉求，我们不会纳入考量——不如说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"如果判断你是罗德岛无法接纳的人，那么即使你既高尚又正直，我们也不能网开一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，仅仅是我的个人诉求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，不管这个，欢迎来到罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说吧，你的行为每时每刻，都会影响到身边干员，身边的干员也会针对你的行为作出决策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你遵守规则，罗德岛会十分宽容地对待你，无论你的过去怎么样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"相反，听着，干员炎客，只要你做出哪怕一丁点出格的事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，我领你去医疗部门吧，有个人想见见你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"——你是？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"抱歉，借过。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"真是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"W，你还真是诚实啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"看来活久一点，确实有些益处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动刀兵"]},{"speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","aliases":["整合运动术师"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜宾"]},{"speakerId":"char_131_flameb","aliases":["？？？","炎客"]},{"speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","aliases":["W"]}]}
